      "parameters": {
        "html": "=<div style=\"background-color:#08090F;padding:26px 12px;width:100%;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#121320;border:1px solid #24273A;border-radius:16px;padding:28px 26px 24px;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#C9CCE4;\">\n      <div style=\"background:#08090F;padding:28px 0;font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"560\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:560px;max-width:92%;background:#121320;border:1px solid #24273A;border-radius:14px;\">\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:30px 32px 8px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E85AE;\">MySweetPea</div>\n        <h1 style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;color:#EEF0FB;font-weight:600;\">Your request is in</h1>\n      </td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:16px 32px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#C9CCE4;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">Hi {{ $('Validate Input').item.json.name }},</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">Thanks for asking. Your request came through and I will look at it myself, usually the same day.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">If it is a fit, you will get a second email with an invite code, and you can set up your account from there. Nothing else is needed from you right now. If you want to add something, just reply to this email.</p>\n      </td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:6px 32px 30px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#A9AFC9;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\">If you did not ask for access, ignore this email and you will not hear from me again.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;\">&mdash; Sweet Pea</p>\n      </td></tr>\n    </table>\n  </td></tr></table>\n</div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "text": "=MySweetPea\n\nYour request is in\n\nHi {{ $('Validate Input').item.json.name }},\n\nThanks for asking. Your request came through and I will look at it myself, usually the same day.\n\nIf it is a fit, you will get a second email with an invite code, and you can set up your account from there. Nothing else is needed from you right now. If you want to add something, just reply to this email.\n\nIf you did not ask for access, ignore this email and you will not hear from me again.\n\n— Sweet Pea\nMySweetPea · https://mysweetpea.cc",
